    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.76,
      254.17,
      401.77,
      277.67
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.96037483215332
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.76,
      291.61,
      401.81,
      315.11
    ],
    "text": "1.(1)This Act may be cited as the Prescription(Amendment) Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1",
      "CIDFont+F2"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.96037483215332
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.76,
      329.17,
      401.82,
      377.63
    ],
    "text": "(2)The provisions of this Act, other than theprovisions of this section, shall come into operation on suchdate as the Minister may appoint by Order published in theGazette.",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.96037483215332
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.76,
      391.57,
      401.8,
      427.67
    ],
    "text": "(3)The provisions of this section shall come intooperation on the date on which the Bill becomes an Act ofParliament.",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.96037483215332
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.76,
      441.61,
      401.98,
      502.67
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 5 of the Prescription Ordinance (Chapter 68)is hereby amended by the substitution for all the words from'' within ten years from the expiration of such time,'' to the endof that section, of the words ''within ten years from the dateof giving notice to the debtor.\".",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1",
      "CIDFont+F2"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.96037483215332
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.76,
      516.61,
      401.76,
      540.11
    ],
    "text": "3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1",
      "CIDFont+F2"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.96037483215332
    ]
